      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "67b859000685cb41",
      "translationZh": "我们正在 Google Flow Music 中推出 Lyria 3.5，在音乐性、歌词、人声和创作控制方面带来进步。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ffb1d232396b3a47",
      "translationZh": "我们最新的音乐生成模型 Lyria 3.5 在音乐性、歌词和人声质量方面实现了显著提升，让你能够创作更丰富的曲目。我们今天开始在 Google Flow Music 中推出该模型，希望帮助你创作自己喜爱的歌曲，同时掌握创作控制权。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "eebaf579bc98416e",
      "translationZh": "音乐性提升：创作更丰富、更复杂且听起来更自然的旋律结构。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "072da031ea4c932c",
      "translationZh": "歌词增强：生成更高质量的歌词，更好地遵循提示，并更好地把握结构。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "eacf949024f5faf9",
      "translationZh": "人声提升：通过更逼真、情感表达更细腻的人声，以及更准确的发音，为你的歌曲注入更多表现力和情感。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1b0d00b091535c88",
      "translationZh": "创作控制：更轻松地控制生成结果的速度和时长。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a35d2d710c4788a7",
      "translationZh": "今天就到 Flow Music 中试试吧。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fefef2f9c6cb957b",
      "translationZh": "我们在 2026 年 9 月公布的最新 AI 新闻",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0427f9d1d93e63e6",
      "translationZh": "我们推出 SynthID Bio，将我们的水印技术引入合成生物学。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
